the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\operatorname{arsech}⁡({3}^{x})] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{{3}^{x}\\sqrt{1-{({3}^{x})}^{2}}}\\cdot {({3}^{x})}^{′} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{{3}^{x}\\sqrt{1-{9}^{x}}}\\cdot {3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3 \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{\\sqrt{1-{9}^{x}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c0fee573-85d6-5302-b91f-3a65063b3585"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c0fee573-85d6-5302-b91f-3a65063b3585" :answer-field/id #uuid "c0fee573-85d6-5302-b91f-3a65063b3585" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-fe2cbb58-2d32-596a-a5ab-d999b693990b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-fe2cbb58-2d32-596a-a5ab-d999b693990b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fe2cbb58-2d32-596a-a5ab-d999b693990b" :answer/id #uuid "fe2cbb58-2d32-596a-a5ab-d999b693990b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\ln 3}{\\sqrt{1-3^{2x}}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-88d8545b-9874-55b6-990b-870f4aec4ac1" :question/id #uuid "88d8545b-9874-55b6-990b-870f4aec4ac1" :question/math-academy-id "q-341522" :question/problem "$$\n\nIf $y=\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(1-x),$ calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cotangent function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above with the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(1-x)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1-(1-x)^{2}}\\cdot (1-x)^{′} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1-(1-2x+{x}^{2})}\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2x-{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}-2x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{x(x-2)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4785fe34-e531-5b8c-856b-b1bf92d27631"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4785fe34-e531-5b8c-856b-b1bf92d27631" :answer-field/id #uuid "4785fe34-e531-5b8c-856b-b1bf92d27631" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-c22ce809-4a35-50df-baa6-93cca13a5284" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c22ce809-4a35-50df-baa6-93cca13a5284"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c22ce809-4a35-50df-baa6-93cca13a5284" :answer/id #uuid "c22ce809-4a35-50df-baa6-93cca13a5284" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x(x-2)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-585fdeed-02dd-5444-8201-a19fa1a46351" :question/id #uuid "585fdeed-02dd-5444-8201-a19fa1a46351" :question/math-academy-id "q-341535" :question/problem "$$\n\nIf $y=3\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\sqrt[3]{x}),$ calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{{x}^{2/3}}$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cotangent function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above with the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[3\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡(\\sqrt[3]{x})] \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{1-{(\\sqrt[3]{x})}^{2}}\\cdot {(\\sqrt[3]{x})}^{′} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{1-\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{x}^{2/3}}\\frac{1}{(1-\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-dffaf696-90ee-57c0-93f5-481258f07333"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-dffaf696-90ee-57c0-93f5-481258f07333" :answer-field/id #uuid "dffaf696-90ee-57c0-93f5-481258f07333" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-ea4045af-0bcf-5dbb-8afa-0d8bfbe1111c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ea4045af-0bcf-5dbb-8afa-0d8bfbe1111c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ea4045af-0bcf-5dbb-8afa-0d8bfbe1111c" :answer/id #uuid "ea4045af-0bcf-5dbb-8afa-0d8bfbe1111c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{1-x^{2/3}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-9ebac606-d705-5196-a808-5592aaa317af" :question/id #uuid "9ebac606-d705-5196-a808-5592aaa317af" :question/math-academy-id "q-95544" :question/problem "$$\n\nIf $y={e}^{-x}-\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡{e}^{-x},$ then $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cotangent function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above with the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{-x}-\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡{e}^{-x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{-x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcoth}⁡{e}^{-x}) \\\\  & =-{e}^{-x}-\\frac{1}{1-({e}^{-x})^{2}}\\cdot ({e}^{-x})^{′} \\\\  & =-{e}^{-x}-\\frac{1}{1-{e}^{-2x}}\\cdot (-{e}^{-x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{-x}}{1-{e}^{-2x}}-{e}^{-x} \\\\  & ={e}^{-x}(\\frac{1}{1-{e}^{-2x}}-1) \\\\  & ={e}^{-x}(\\frac{{e}^{-2x}}{1-{e}^{-2x}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{1-{e}^{-2x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-204adb77-c138-51ef-abaa-2ad33fd463d7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-204adb77-c138-51ef-abaa-2ad33fd463d7" :answer-field/id #uuid "204adb77-c138-51ef-abaa-2ad33fd463d7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0e7a943d-54c5-5b0f-baea-e089dd6d6ed8" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6c93b3da-a9ec-50eb-83e6-da32af5214d